error[NK1171]: `Wide[u64]` has no method called `abs`.
  --> tests/wide_of_an_unsigned_has_no_abs.nika:6:2
   |
 6 | 	let m = w.abs()
   |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `abs` gives the magnitude of a signed value; a `Wide[u64]` is never below zero, so it is its own magnitude (Part I 2.2).
   = help: Use the value as it is.
